<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The chat input provides contextual hints and adapts to your content."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Contextual Placeholder")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "The placeholder text changes based on your current context:")}<br />{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "In a channel:"
  )}
  <em>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Message to %{target} — / for commands", target: "#channel")}
  </em>
  <br />{dgettext("help_features", "In a PM:")}
  <em>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Message to %{target} — / for commands", target: "NickName")}
  </em>
  <br />{dgettext("help_features", "In Status:")}
  <em>{dgettext("help_features", "Type a command — / for list")}</em>
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_notepad}>{dgettext("help_features", "Multi-Line Expansion")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The input grows vertically as you type or paste multi-line text, up to 5 visible lines. Beyond that, a scrollbar appears. The chat messages area compresses above to make room."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_cheatsheet}>{dgettext("help_features", "Keyboard")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Enter")}</strong> {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "— Send message."
  )}<br />
  <strong>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Shift+Enter")}
  </strong>
  {dgettext("help_features", "— Insert a new line.")}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The placeholder always names the conversation your message will go to. In the Status window it reminds you that only commands work there."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "More Keys in the Input")}</.help_h4>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>{dgettext("help_features", "Keys")}</th>
      <th>{dgettext("help_features", "Action")}</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <.keycap>↑</.keycap>
        /
        <.keycap>↓</.keycap>
      </td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Browse the messages and commands you sent before.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <.keycap>↑</.keycap>
      </td>
      <td>
        {dgettext(
          "help_features",
          "In an empty input, edit your last message in this conversation."
        )}
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <.keycap>Ctrl+R</.keycap>
      </td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Search your input history.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <.keycap>Tab</.keycap>
      </td>
      <td>
        {dgettext(
          "help_features",
          "Complete a nickname. Press it again to cycle through the matches."
        )}
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>
        <.keycap>Escape</.keycap>
      </td>
      <td>
        {dgettext(
          "help_features",
          "Close the suggestion list or the history search, or cancel an edit."
        )}
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_fmt_bold}>{dgettext("help_features", "Formatting Keys")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "These keys insert an IRC formatting code at the cursor. Type your text after the code."
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <.keycap>Ctrl+Shift+B</.keycap>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Bold")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <.keycap>Ctrl+Shift+Y</.keycap>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Italic")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <.keycap>Ctrl+Shift+U</.keycap>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Underline")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <.keycap>Ctrl+Shift+D</.keycap>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Color")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <.keycap>Ctrl+Shift+V</.keycap>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Reverse")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <.keycap>Ctrl+Shift+X</.keycap>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Reset formatting")}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Notes")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "On a narrow screen such as a phone, the input grows up to 3 lines instead of 5. A message can be edited only within 5 minutes after you send it."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-enhanced-history">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Enhanced History")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-command-syntax-tooltip">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Command Syntax Tooltip")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-char-counter">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Character Counter")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-autocomplete">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Autocomplete")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-message-edit">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Message Edit")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
